      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I'm the fastest.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Я найшвидший.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q3" name="=&gt;q3">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">6</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Don't be flinging any coins in the air. Reflexes.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Не кидай монети в повітря. Рефлекси.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q4" name="=&gt;q4">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">8</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I can shoot a fly off a rathound's snout... without killing the fly.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Я можу збити муху з носа rathound'а... не вбиваючи муху.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q5" name="=&gt;q5">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">10</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>My bullets bear no names.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">У моїх кулях немає імен.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q6" name="=&gt;q6">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">12</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>When others draw... they die.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Коли інші витягують... вони помирають.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q7" name="=&gt;q7">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">14</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Spins his gun.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">::Крутить пістолетом.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q8" name="=&gt;q8">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">16</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I got more than one gun, baby...&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">У мене більше одного пістолета, дитинко...&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q9" name="=&gt;q9">
      <mda:metadata>
